# --- things that cost money / leak data if committed ---
# executed practice notebooks may embed real API responses + fixture data.
# The pre-commit hook strips outputs on commit; these are backstops.
projects/practice/**/lab.local.ipynb
projects/practice/**/*.run.ipynb
**/trace_dump*.json
**/eval_run_*.json
**/*.responses.jsonl
cost_report*.csv
.llm_cache/

